# Decrypted report sources. NEVER COMMIT THESE.
# This repo is public and served by GitHub Pages. reports/ holds the encrypted
# wrappers that are safe to publish; reports-src/ holds the same documents in
# clear text, including confidential client data. Committing it would publish
# every report and make the encryption pointless.
reports-src/

# Rendered PDFs of the reports. Also never commit these: they are the same
# confidential content with no password gate at all, and this repo is public.
reports/*.pdf
